        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-YI-SANITIZED.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-YI-SANITIZED-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH236-HEXAGRAM-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH237-GARBAGE-REJECT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH238-SANITIZED-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH239-YI-DAI-FOLD-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH240-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-YI-SANITIZED-WITNESS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-YI-SANITIZED.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-YI-SANITIZED.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH236-HEXAGRAM-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH237-GARBAGE-REJECT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH238-SANITIZED-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH239-YI-DAI-FOLD-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH240-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-YI-SANITIZED-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-YI-SANITIZED-WITNESS.
